ebGPU renderer.\n13: - Run `playwright-cli screenshot --filename=screenshots/linux.png` after creating the output directory.\n14: - Inspect the image. Reject loading screens, empty grids, and blank canvases.\n15: - Report SwiftShader as CPU software rendering. Do not claim GPU hardware acceleration.\n16: - Inspect `$HOME/.local/share/omgithub-playwright/linux.json` for launch settings.\n17: - Use `playwright-cli --help` for commands and named sessions. Pass configuration only to `open`.\n18: \n19: ## Mobile browser games\n20: \n21: - Support Android and iOS phones and tablets with responsive layouts and usable touch controls.\n22: - Keep gameplay and controls visible within safe areas and avoid browser gesture conflicts.\n23: - Add tilt controls only when appropriate; offer touch alternatives and request iOS motion permission from a user gesture when needed.\n24: - Follow explicit device and control requirements in the user request."}],"metadata":{"truncated":false}},"time":{"created":1794091642288,"ran":1794091643888,"completed":1794091643920}},{"type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9cf3210d44792c19","name":"read","executed":false,"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"start.sh"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file start.sh, lines 1-4\n1: #!/usr/bin/env bash\n2: set -euo pipefail\n3: cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\n4: /usr/bin/time -p node \"${RUNTIME_DIR:?}/scripts/default-start.mjs\""}],"metadata":{"truncated":false}},"time":{"created":1794091642706,"ran":1794091643893,"completed":1794091643922}},{"type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8ae601a42f9be627","name":"read","executed":false,"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"capture.sh"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file capture.sh, lines 1-4\n1: #!/usr/bin/env bash\n2: set -euo pipefail\n3: cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\n4: /usr/bin/time -p node \"${RUNTIME_DIR:?}/scripts/default-capture.mjs\""}],"metadata":{"truncated":false}},"time":{"created":1794091642710,"ran":1794091643899,"completed":1794091643