bine to reduce import complexity. Modules:\n- `world.js`: constants, RNG, map gen, props, NPC, markers, tile textures? Textures maybe render.\n- `audio.js`: Audio class.\n- `main.js`: state, input, loop, render, UI.\nCould still be 2000 lines. Let's split render helpers.\n\nLet's start with world generation. Need careful deterministic map and placement.\n\nWorld size 64. We'll use value noise. Functions:\n```\nmulberry32(seed)\nhash2(x,y)\nvalueNoise(x,y)\nfbm(x,y,oct)\n```\nMap:\n```\nfor y,x:\n  elev = 0\n  // highlands ellipse center (13,15), radius 14\n  d = sqrt(((x-13)/13)^2+((y-15)/11)^2)\n  high = clamp((1-d)*2.8,0,2.2)\n  // rolling hills east\n  elev += max(0, fbm(x*.08,y*.08)-.55)*2\n  elev = round(elev*2)/2? \n```\nBetter heights continuous but top rendering uses rounded 0.5. Player z smooth.\n\nWater:\n- lake ellipse center (13,49) rx=10, ry=7, with noisy edge.\n- river from north (43,0)? Let's do small stream in forest: from (50,0) to (45,20), not necessary.\n- pond village at (38,46) radius 3.\n- maybe river diagonal from (8,0) to (20,40) would split highlands. Avoid.\n\nSet water if inside lake.\nBeach sand near lake.\n\nPaths: road polylines list. For each tile compute distance to segment; if < 1.3 set path (if not water). Make wide 2 tiles near village.\nRoads:\nA village loop / main:\n[(32,50),(32,44),(31,40),(31,36),(32,33),(32,30)]\nB to forest:\n[(32,36),(36,34),(40,32),(44,29),(47,25),(47,20),(48,17)]\nC to lake:\n[(31,42),(28,44),(25,45),(21,46),(17,45),(14,44),(11,44)]\nD to highlands:\n[(31,36),(28,32),(25,28),(21,24),(18,20),(16,17),(15,14)]\nE to sanctum from village:\n[(32,36),(32,33),(32,30)] central.\nAlso road to sanctum arena [(32,30),(32,27),(32,24)].\n\nNeed path endpoints at shrines. Place shrine at (49,16) forest, (10,43) lake shore, (15,13) highlands. Main sanctum gate at (32,29), arena center (32,23). Maybe gate blocks road at y=28.\n\nVillage plaza center (31,41). Houses:\n(27,39), (35,39), (25,43), (37,44), maybe inn (34,47), blacksmith (27,46). Need avoid roads. Use tile type path? Fine.\n\nTile types:\n- grass (lush), grass2, path, sand, water, stone, forestfloor, highland, flowers, bridge.\n- tiles have variant 0..3.\n\nRegions:\n- forest floor when x>40 and y<30 plus dense trees.\n- highland when elev>0.7.\n- dark grass near ruins maybe.\n- stone around sanctum and shrines.\n\nProp generation:\nUse seeded random. For each tile, depending type:\n- forest: 0.28 tree chance, bush 0.08, mushroom 0.05.\n- grass: tree 0.04, bush 0.06, flowers 0.03.\n- highland: rock 0.12, pine 0.04.\n- near water: reeds.\n- avoid near paths, village, shrine, roads.\n- add handcrafted trees around village.\nProps include blockers. Need avoid putting props on road or in NPC areas. Use map type check.\n- Village houses at set coords with dimensions 2x2, door etc. Need add as prop with collision radius 1.3.\n- Fences around gardens, crates.\n- Signpost.\n\nNPCs:\n- Elder Maelin at (31,40) near plaza. \n- Merchant Lira at (35,42) near stall.\n- Fisher Finn at (11,44) near lake shrine? Maybe.\n- Child Pip at (30,44).\n- Hermit in highlands at (17,16).\nDialogue based on quest.\n\nInteractables:\n- wardstones at positions. Each has id forest/lake/sky. glowing if not activated. Use prop? separate `shrines`.\n- chests: 3 chests with rupees/heart piece maybe. Chest state.\n- signs.\n- sanctum gate.\n\nBoss arena: stone circle at (32,24), surrounded by pillars. Gate at (32,29) with energy barrier until open. Boss spawns when player enters radius 4 after gate open. Victory.\n\nNeed collision with gate barrier if not open. Add blocker rectangle/circle at (32,29). When open, remove.\n\nMap shape: need boundaries invisible maybe ocean cliffs. Add water border? Could surround map with dense forest/mountains; world edge blocked.\n\nMap markers: shrine positions, village, sanctum, boss.\n\nQuest stage:\n0 = \"Speak with Elder Maelin\"\n1 = \"Restore the Wardstones\" with 0/3\n2 = \"Enter the Sunken Sanctum\"\n3 = \"Defeat the Hollow King\"\n4 = \"The Crown is Restored\" (victory)\nElder dialogue stage 0 advances to 1. On start maybe show quest marker to elder.\nEach shrine activation:\n- if quest stage 1 and not active: active, stones++ max hearts++, big VFX, toast \"Wardstone awakened! Max hearts +1\".\n- If all 3: quest stage 2, open gate, toast, waypoint.\nBoss defeat -> stage 4, victory overlay with stats/time; maybe \"Continue exploring\" button. Keep world playable.\n\nNPC dialogue lines:\nElder:\nstage0: \"The Verdant Crown has dimmed... Three Wardstones...\" then stage=1.\nstage1: \"The stones sleep in grove, shore, and highlands. Seek them...\"\nstage2: \"The Sanctum gate is open. The Hollow King waits...\"\nstage3: \"Courage, young one.\"\nstage4: \"You did it...\"\nMerchant: \"Potions? I only have gossip and apples...\" Could implement shop? A simple shop overlay would add depth. Maybe buy heart (3 rupees) and stamina charm? We can add shop UI with buttons? That's extra. Could make merchant give free apple once per run. Keep simple but robust. Maybe implement shop:\n- Interact opens dialog with option? UI supports choices. Complexity. Could skip. Add \"Merchant Lira sells a heart for 5 rupees\" via dialogue and auto if enough? Not ideal. Maybe use a shop panel. We can implement generic choice buttons in dialog. Good but time.\n\nWe have huge token budget but need finish. Let's focus on core polish.\n\nCollectibles:\n- Rupees dropped by cutting grass? Add breakable pots/grass tufts? Could have \"bushes\" that can be slashed, drop hearts/rupees. Nice.\n- Trees no.\n- Enemies drop 1-3 rupees.\n\nWorld events:\n- wind sway on trees.\n- butterflies daytime.\n- fireflies night.\n- rain? Maybe optional. Day/night enough.\n\nVisual quality is key. Need render an appealing scene. Let's make art style soft \"storybook\" with rich palette: teal-green, warm gold, lavender shadows. Use gradients, outline. Add vignette and color grading. UI with serif font (system Georgia?) Use Google fonts? Network unavailable perhaps. Better use built-in `Georgia` for title and `Trebuchet MS`/system sans. But UI style could use 'Cinzel'? No external. We can embed no. Use CSS font stack `\"Palatino Linotype\", \"Book Antiqua\", Georgia, serif` for headings and `\"Avenir Next\", \"Segoe UI\", system-ui` for body. Good.\n\nCreate vignette via CSS overlay `radial-gradient`.\nAdd grain overlay using CSS noise data URI maybe. Or canvas generated? Use subtle repeating pattern.\nNeed \"isometric\" clear.\n\nRenderer details:\n- Tile texture generation. Let's define canvas sprites:\n```\nfunction makeTileTexture(type, variant) { \n const c=document.createElement('canvas'); c.width=TW; c.height=TH;\n path diamond; clip;\n fill gradient (top color to bottom color);\n add noise dots/blades.\n for path: pebbles, wheel tracks.\n water: gradient + waves.\n sand: speckles.\n stone: cracks.\n highland: moss patches.\n}\n```\nAt draw, use drawImage. Water animate with overlay shimmer drawn over tile. Could generate 2 variants and alternate.\n\n- Edges between grass and path: tile texture doesn't blend. Add subtle outlines? Path tiles rectangular diamond may show. We can draw path with soft irregular edges? In pre-render, fill with rounded organic border inside diamond; okay.\n- tile transition overlay? We can draw a subtle stroke of darker green on grass around. Fine.\n\n- Ambient occlusion between tiles: not needed.\n\n- Cliff sides: use dark earthy color, draw horizontal rock lines.\n\n- Shadows: props draw ellipse with `rgba(10,30,25,.22)`.\n\n- Trees: Several types:\n  1. Broadleaf: trunk brown, canopy clusters with layered circles/ellipses in greens, highlight top-left, shadow bottom. Sway with sin. Height 100-130.\n  2. Pine: trunk + triangular tiers in dark teal. \n  3. Palm? near lake: curved trunk and fronds.\n  4. Ancient tree maybe.\n- Trees cast long shadows to bottom-left? Use ellipse/skewed polygon.\n\n- Houses: iso-ish cottage: walls as parallelogram, thatched roof diamond with layered straw. Draw with base at tile. Need orient consistent. Could draw simple 3/4 isometric house:\n  - shadow.\n  - front wall polygon from left to bottom etc.\n  - roof as two sloped quads.\n  - door, window glowing at night.\n  - chimney smoke particles maybe.\n- Shrines: standing stones with runic circles, floating orb, glow.\n- Sanctum gate: two tall pillars with arch, energy barrier.\n- Boss: stone giant.\n\nNeed all vector draw functions.\n\nCould produce multiple props via draw functions with time.\n\nScreen shake: offset camera by random.\n\nParticle system: world particles (leaves, fireflies, sparkles, hit) drawn in screen coords after entities or before? Hit particles overlay. Ambient particles sorted? Draw after props for visibility, but fireflies okay.\n\nWater shimmer: draw small white curves at random positions for visible water tiles, time-based. Need deterministic. Could use per-tile hash and sin.\n\nDay/night overlay: fill screen with color at alpha, plus lantern glows. Use `ctx.globalCompositeOperation='multiply'`? Could fill with rgba navy .35. Then lighten windows via additive. Simpler: tint overlay using `source-over` with rgba(20,30,80, alpha)` and then draw glow circles `lighter`. At night add stars? Sky not visible, but vignette.\n\nThe game world fills viewport, no sky. Fine.\n\nCamera:\n```\ncam.sx = player screenX; cam.sy = player screenY - 20\nsmooth\n```\nNeed follow with dead zone? simple lerp.\n\nInput mapping:\n- keyboard set vector.\n- joystick pointer delta relative to base.\n- faceAngle based on screen input if moving.\n- if no input keep facing.\n- attack action if button.\n- interact nearest.\n\nMovement:\n- speed 4.6 tiles/sec; dash 9.5.\n- screen movement vector from joystick, then convert to world.\n- world coords units = tiles. Iso projection.\n- collision check circles for props. Also water tile. World bounds.\n- elevation smooth lerp to `elevAt`.\n- footsteps particles at intervals.\n\nCombat:\n- attack timer; cooldown .38; range 1.5; arc dot > .25. For enemies and breakables.\n- attack event at t=0.1? immediate.\n- damage enemies 1, boss 1. Knockback.\n- enemy contact damage with invuln 1.2s and blink.\n- enemy AI states idle/chase/attack.\n- enemies spawn list with respawn timers if killed (except boss). Keep around 20.\n- boss behavior:\n   state intro (2s), idle, charge, slam, summon.\n   HP 30. At 50% phase 2, faster.\n   shockwave rings damage if player within radius band.\n   rock projectiles.\n   Boss arena confined? Add invisible barrier at gate during fight maybe.\n- boss health bar shown.\n\nPlayer health UI: 5 hearts start (maybe 6 for mobile forgiving). Each stone +1. Boss 3 hearts damage. Pickups.\n- death: fade, respawn at village elder, lose 2 rupees, restore hearts; enemies reset. Toast \"The forest carries you home...\"\n- no game over hard.\n\nSave:\n- localStorage key. Save state only flags, position, hearts/rupees, time.\n- autosave on shrine activation and pause. Load on continue. Save shows.\n- New game resets.\n- On load, reconstruct world static deterministic, apply flags, place player.\n\nImportant: initial world uses random but deterministic seed; props based on seed. Save stores player and flags, not world. Good.\n\nIntro:\n- HTML overlay with title. Buttons: \"Continue\" if save, \"New Journey\"; controls hints. On click hide and start.\n- Game starts paused until click. Render scene behind overlay with camera at village. Add gentle animation.\n- Use `aria` and responsive.\n\nCould add onboarding tooltip after start: \"Follow the golden marker to Elder Maelin\" and controls. Fine.\n\nSound:\nAudio module with `init`, `sfx(name)`, `setMuted`, `update(region,time)`. Ambient generative:\n- master gain low.\n- chords every 8 seconds: pad notes based on scale.\n- pluck arpeggio every 1.5 sec, soft.\n- night crickets noise.\n- water near lake.\nMaybe simpler: schedule loop via setInterval in Audio. Use oscillators with attack/release. We'll implement.\n- sfx: swing noise sweep, hit thump, pickup ping, heal chime, shrine chord, dialogue blip, boss roar.\nNeed not be perfect but adds.\n\nPerformance:\n- Pre-render tile textures at init.\n- Prop draw functions each frame may be heavy for 100 visible. Fine.\n- DPR cap 2, and maybe max 1.5 on mobile? Use min(devicePixelRatio, 2). For high res mobile, 2 okay. Render at CSS size * dpr. Could cap to 1.75. We'll use 2 but if width*height huge, reduce.\n\nNeed ensure canvas uses CSS width 100vw height 100dvh. `image-rendering` no.\n\nNeed maybe orientation hint? User says phone/tablet. Support both; no forced. Could add `@media (orientation: landscape)` adjust controls. Fine.\n\nPotential browser gesture conflicts: `touch-action:none; overscroll-behavior:none; user-select:none;` and prevent double-tap zoom.\n\nLet's write files. Start with index.html and style.","native":{"reasoningField":"reasoning_content"},"time":{"created":1794091715386,"completed":1794091814135}},{"type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a1c3a574c500421f","name":"write","executed":false,"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover, user-scalable=no, maximum-scale=1\" />\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#102a25\" />\n  <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\" />\n  <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"black-translucent\" />\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Verdant Crown — an isometric open-world adventure for phone and tablet.\" />\n  <title>The Verdant Crown</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main id=\"game-shell\" aria-label=\"The Verdant Crown game\">\n    <canvas id=\"game\" aria-label=\"Isometric adventure world\"></canvas>\n\n    <div id=\"vignette\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div id=\"grain\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n    <div id=\"hud\" class=\"hud is-hidden\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <section class=\"hud-left\" aria-label=\"Player status\">\n        <div class=\"hearts\" id=\"hearts\"></div>\n        <div class=\"stamina-wrap\" aria-label=\"Stamina\">\n          <div class=\"stamina-ring\"><div class=\"stamina-fill\" id=\"staminaFill\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rupee-pill\" aria-label=\"Rupees\">\n          <span class=\"rupee-gem\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <span id=\"rupeeCount\">0</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"quest-card\" id=\"questCard\" aria-label=\"Current quest\">\n        <div class=\"quest-eyebrow\" id=\"questEyebrow\">THE VERDANT CROWN</div>\n        <div class=\"quest-title\" id=\"questTitle\">Speak with Elder Maelin</div>\n        <div class=\"quest-progress\" id=\"questProgress\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"hud-right\">\n        <div class=\"minimap-wrap\">\n          <canvas id=\"minimap\" width=\"184\" height=\"184\" aria-label=\"World map\"></canvas>\n          <div class=\"minimap-ring\"></div>\n          <div class=\"compass-n\">N</div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"icon-button menu-button\" id=\"pauseButton\" aria-label=\"Pause and open menu\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 5h3.2v14H7zM13.8 5H17v14h-3.2z\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"objective-toast\" id=\"objectiveToast\" role=\"status\"></div>\n      <div class=\"area-banner\" id=\"areaBanner\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <span class=\"area-rule\"></span>\n        <span id=\"areaName\">Mossbell Village</span>\n        <span class=\"area-rule\"></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"boss-bar is-hidden\" id=\"bossBar\">\n        <div class=\"boss-name\">THE HOLLOW KING</div>\n        <div class=\"boss-track\"><div class=\"boss-fill\" id=\"bossFill\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"touchControls\" class=\"touch-controls is-hidden\" aria-label=\"Touch controls\">\n      <div class=\"joystick\" id=\"joystick\" aria-label=\"Movement joystick\">\n        <div class=\"joystick-base\"></div>\n        <div class=\"joystick-knob\" id=\"joystickKnob\"></div>\n        <div class=\"joystick-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"action-cluster\">\n        <button class=\"action-button dash-button\" id=\"dashButton\" aria-label=\"Dash\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h7l-3 5h4l-3 5h4l-4 4H3l3-5H2l3-5H1z\" opacity=\".95\"/></svg>\n          <span>DASH</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"action-button attack-button\" id=\"attackButton\" aria-label=\"Sword attack\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.6 2.2 21.8 3.4 10.5 14.7l-2.2.9.9-2.2L20.6 2.2zM7.8 14.4l1.8 1.8-4.2 4.2-1.8-1.8z\"/><path d=\"M5.4 17.7 3.3 19.8l.9.9 2.1-2.1z\" opacity=\".7\"/></svg>\n          <span>STRIKE</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"action-button interact-button\" id=\"interactButton\" aria-label=\"Interact\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4c0 1.5-.8 2.8-2 3.5v2h3.5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2.3h-3v5.2H7.5v-5.2h-3V14a2 2 0 0 1 2-2H10v-2a4 4 0 0 1 2-7.5z\"/></svg>\n          <span>USE</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"interactPrompt\" class=\"interact-prompt is-hidden\"><span class=\"prompt-key\">E</span><span id=\"interactLabel\">Talk</span></div>\n\n    <div id=\"dialog\" class=\"dialog is-hidden\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"dialog-card\">\n        <div class=\"dialog-portrait\" id=\"dialogPortrait\"></div>\n        <div class=\"dialog-copy\">\n          <div class=\"dialog-name\" id=\"dialogName\">Elder Maelin</div>\n          <p class=\"dialog-text\" id=\"dialogText\"></p>\n          <div class=\"dialog-actions\" id=\"dialogActions\">\n            <button class=\"dialog-next\" id=\"dialogNext\">Continue <span aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"pauseMenu\" class=\"menu-overlay is-hidden\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Pause menu\">\n      <div class=\"menu-panel\">\n        <div class=\"menu-crest\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</div>\n        <h2>Journey Paused</h2>\n        <p class=\"menu-sub\" id=\"menuLocation\">Mossbell Village</p>\n        <div class=\"menu-stats\">\n          <div><span id=\"menuStones\">0</span><small>Wardstones</small></div>\n          <div><span id=\"menuRupees\">0</span><small>Rupees</small></div>\n          <div><span id=\"menuTime\">0:00</span><small>Journey</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-buttons\">\n          <button class=\"primary-button\" id=\"resumeButton\">Resume</button>\n          <button class=\"secondary-button\" id=\"saveButton\">Save Journey</button>\n          <button class=\"secondary-button\" id=\"controlsButton\">Controls</button>\n          <button class=\"secondary-button danger\" id=\"newGameButton\">New Journey</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-foot\">Progress saves automatically at wardstones.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"controlsPanel\" class=\"menu-overlay is-hidden\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Controls\">\n      <div class=\"menu-panel controls-panel\">\n        <h2>How to Play</h2>\n        <div class=\"control-grid\">\n          <div class=\"control-item\"><span class=\"keycap\">WASD</span><p>Move through the world. On touch, use the left joystick.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"control-item\"><span class=\"keycap\">J / SPACE</span><p>Swing your sword. Tap <b>Strike</b> on touch.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"control-item\"><span class=\"keycap\">E</span><p>Talk, read, open, and awaken. Tap <b>Use</b> on touch.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"control-item\"><span class=\"keycap\">SHIFT</span><p>Dash with a burst of speed. Tap <b>Dash</b> on touch.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"control-tip\">Golden light marks your next goal. Restore the three Wardstones, then face the Hollow King beneath the old sanctum.</p>\n        <button class=\"primary-button\" id=\"closeControls\">Back</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"victory\" class=\"victory is-hidden\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"victory-inner\">\n        <div class=\"victory-rays\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"victory-crown\" aria-hidden=\"true\">♛</div>\n        <p class=\"victory-eyebrow\">THE VERDANT CROWN</p>\n        <h1>The Hollow King<br /><em>Falls</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"victory-copy\">Light returns to the valley. The roots remember your name.</p>\n        <div class=\"victory-stats\">\n          <div><span id=\"victoryTime\">0:00</span><small>Journey</small></div>\n          <div><span id=\"victoryRupees\">0</span><small>Rupees</small></div>\n          <div><span id=\"victoryHearts\">0</span><small>Hearts</small></div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"primary-button\" id=\"victoryContinue\">Keep Exploring</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"titleScreen\" class=\"title-screen\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Title screen\">\n      <div class=\"title-shade\"></div>\n      <div class=\"title-content\">\n        <p class=\"title-kicker\">AN ISOMETRIC ADVENTURE</p>\n        <h1 class=\"game-title\">The<br /><span>Verdant Crown</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"title-sub\">A sleeping valley. Three broken wardstones.<br />One small hero with a very sharp sword.</p>\n        <div class=\"title-actions\">\n          <button class=\"primary-button title-start\" id=\"startButton\">Begin Journey</button>\n          <button class=\"secondary-button title-continue is-hidden\" id=\"continueButton\">Continue</button>\n          <button class=\"text-button\" id=\"titleControls\">How to play</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"title-hint\">\n          <span><i class=\"dot desktop-dot\"></i>WASD to move</span>\n          <span><i class=\"dot desktop-dot\"></i>J to strike</span>\n          <span><i class=\"dot touch-dot\"></i>Touch controls on phone &amp; tablet</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"title-footer\">\n        <span>✦</span>\n        <span>An open-world storybook adventure</span>\n        <span>✦</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"loading\" class=\"loading\"><div class=\"loading-mark\">✦</div><p>Waking the valley…</p></div>\n    <div id=\"rotateHint\" class=\"rotate-hint\"><div>↻</div><p>Turn your device for a wider view</p></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"./src/main.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: index.html"}],"metadata":{"truncated":false}},"time":{"created":1794091797178,"ran":1794091814141,"completed":1794091814150}}],"snapshot":{"start":"33e6b05a7db106b7347baf1522d96acff1e56429","end":"f85d116a96517243eb084a160ed9520c2177f489","files":["index.html"]},"finish":"tool-calls","rawFinish":"tool_calls","cost":0,"tokens":{"input":250,"output":2880,"reasoning":7361,"cache":{"read":58496,"write":0}}},{"id":"msg_1b8348d2b001LgTTmiktqk38bA","time":{"created":1794091814192,"streamed":1794091883599,"completed":1794091883636},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"oc/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free","providerID":"omdev","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now CSS. Need polished. Let's write ~800 lines.","native":{"reasoningField":"reasoning_content"},"time":{"created":1794091819722,"completed":1794091883594}},{"type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-aafd29ee291cc119","name":"write","executed":false,"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/st