generation and canvas rendering, plus quests, interactions, combat, movement, keyboard/touch input, pause/dialog/victory flows, and local save/load.\n- `node --check src/main.js` passed.\n- Started the local server on port 3002; `curl -I http://localhost:3002` returned HTTP 200.\n- Installed Playwright Chromium after browser launch initially failed because it was not installed.\n\n### Active\n- Validate the game in a browser, exercise gameplay and mobile layout, and fix any defects.\n- Capture and inspect the latest small JPEG screenshot.\n\n### Blocked\n- Browser validation has not yet been rerun after installing Chromium; no screenshot or gameplay verification has been collected.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Open `http://localhost:3002` with `playwright-cli` and check for runtime errors.\n2. Test title-to-game flow, movement, interactions, combat, save/load, and mobile layout; fix any issues.\n3. Capture a JPEG screenshot at viewport width ≤1280px and inspect only the latest screenshot.\n4. Summarize the finished game and briefly note assumptions.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `src/main.js`: Game logic, world generation, and rendering.\n- `index.html`: Game UI, element IDs, and module import.\n- `styles.css`: Responsive game, HUD, dialogs, and touch-control styling.\n- `start.sh`: Project startup workflow.\n- `capture.sh`: Screenshot capture workflow.\n\n## Important Context\n- Changes are uncommitted.\n- The previous targeted tile-bounds edit failed, but the newer `drawWorld()` draws visible tiles by screen-space culling, superseding that earlier approach.","cost":0,"tokens":{"input":3,"output":474,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"read":2474,"write":28731}}},{"id":"msg_1b83e0f14001YOjJMB5dNJJ5mt","time":{"created":1794092437282,"streamed":1794092441496,"completed":1794092443551},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"fusion","providerID":"copilot-fusion-direct","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"","native":{"itemId":"","reasoningEncryptedContent":""},